    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Red Is Lava</strong>, the setup is simple but unforgiving. Get ready for a challenging arcade platformer where a single mistake can be fatal! You control a cube that changes color with every jump and paints the platforms it touches, transforming the world with every move. Touch a red platform or one of a different color than yours, and you die!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a straightforward yet addictive gameplay, you'll find yourself jumping, dodging, and adapting quickly to color changes in order to survive a world that gets more and more unforgiving after each jump.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Platforming:</strong> In <strong>Red Is Lava</strong>, there\u2019s no room for error. Every move counts, and each jump must be calculated with pinpoint accuracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Challenge:</strong> No complicated storylines\u2014just pure, unadulterated action. With 64 levels full of obstacles, each one tougher than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Neon Visuals:</strong> The game features a clean, vibrant neon aesthetic that highlights the platforms and obstacles, making the colorful world pop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgiving Difficulty:</strong> If you\u2019re a fan of tough games like <i>Super Meat Boy</i> and <i>VVVVVV</i>, <strong>Red Is Lava</strong> will be your new addiction. Get ready for a learning curve that will push your skills and patience to their limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precise and Fluid Controls:</strong> The gameplay focuses on fast, accurate reflexes, with responsive controls that make every move feel crisp and deliberate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Action:</strong> Quick levels, quick deaths, and instant retries. No fluff, no story\u2014just you, your cube, and the deadly red.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Red Is Lava</strong>, the setup is simple but unforgiving. Get ready for a challenging arcade platformer where a single mistake can be fatal! You control a cube that changes color with every jump and paints the platforms it touches, transforming the world with every move. Touch a red platform or one of a different color than yours, and you die!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a straightforward yet addictive gameplay, you'll find yourself jumping, dodging, and adapting quickly to color changes in order to survive a world that gets more and more unforgiving after each jump.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Platforming:</strong> In <strong>Red Is Lava</strong>, there\u2019s no room for error. Every move counts, and each jump must be calculated with pinpoint accuracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade Challenge:</strong> No complicated storylines\u2014just pure, unadulterated action. With 64 levels full of obstacles, each one tougher than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Neon Visuals:</strong> The game features a clean, vibrant neon aesthetic that highlights the platforms and obstacles, making the colorful world pop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgiving Difficulty:</strong> If you\u2019re a fan of tough games like <i>Super Meat Boy</i> and <i>VVVVVV</i>, <strong>Red Is Lava</strong> will be your new addiction. Get ready for a learning curve that will push your skills and patience to their limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precise and Fluid Controls:</strong> The gameplay focuses on fast, accurate reflexes, with responsive controls that make every move feel crisp and deliberate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Action:</strong> Quick levels, quick deaths, and instant retries. No fluff, no story\u2014just you, your cube, and the deadly red.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In Red Is Lava, every jump counts! Control a color-shifting cube and paint the world as you leap through challenging levels. Touch the platform of the wrong color or the deadly red, and you die. Prepare for intense, precise action with no room for error! Can you survive?",
